  "description": "Pad vibration scripts. A script is a run of steps; the game starts one by the position of its first step in this list (0..47), so the order is the interface and must not change. Each step has a name (next / spawn refer to steps by name) and an op: command, waveform or pulse. Waveform samples: bytes_per_sample 0 = one bit per sample (bit 0 of each byte first), 1..4 = big-endian levels (0x80 = full strength); duration and ticks_per_sample are in ticks of 1/300 s. Channel 0 is the small on/off motor, channel 1 the large one. A mod replaces the whole file with its own copy at the same path.",
